WEBVTT

00:09:27.688 --> 00:09:30.983
is specifically to avoid
having to spend time

00:09:31.025 --> 00:09:33.402
and interact with other
human beings in real life.

00:09:33.444 --> 00:09:34.445
(Laughter)

00:09:34.445 --> 00:09:36.989
So I want to assure you
that it is worth it,

00:09:37.031 --> 00:09:39.283
and it is not as hard as it might seem.

00:09:39.325 --> 00:09:40.784
So here's how you do it.

00:09:40.826 --> 00:09:42.953
You start by making
eye contact with someone.

00:09:42.953 --> 00:09:44.330
Like, look them in the eye,

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.415
don't look in the middle
of their forehead,

00:09:46.415 --> 00:09:48.417
where the camera would be on a Zoom call.

00:09:48.417 --> 00:09:49.627
(Laughter)

00:09:49.627 --> 00:09:51.462
And you say “Hello.”

00:09:51.503 --> 00:09:54.632
And if that goes well,
you can introduce yourself.

00:09:54.965 --> 00:09:56.133
And if that goes well,

00:09:56.175 --> 00:09:59.470
maybe you can ask them a question,
something that's thought-provoking,

00:09:59.511 --> 00:10:01.430
but not overly personal or threatening,